    <Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_MAO_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>人民战争</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_MAO_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>People’s War</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_MAO_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>近战和抗骑兵单位+1移动力；己方领土内+5战斗力；对受损单位+5战斗力；战斗经验+50%。</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_MAO_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Melee and anti-cavalry units gain +1 Movement, +5 Combat Strength in friendly territory, +5 against wounded units and +50% combat experience.</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_MAO_RED_ARMY_NAME" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>工农红军</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_MAO_RED_ARMY_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Workers’ and Peasants’ Red Army</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_MAO_RED_ARMY_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>共产党的特色文艺复兴近战单位，替代火枪手。基础移动力比火枪手+1，可与人民战争的移动力加成叠加。击败敌方单位后恢复20生命值。在任何领土均可按回合恢复生命值，即使已移动或执行行动。</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_UNIT_MAO_RED_ARMY_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Unique Renaissance melee unit of the Communist Party, replacing the Musketman. +1 base Movement, stacking with People’s War. Heals 20 HP after defeating an enemy unit. Can heal each turn in any territory, even after moving or acting.</Text>
    </Row>
