    <Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_COMMUNIST_SPARK_NAME" Language="en_US">
      <Text>A Single Spark</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_COMMUNIST_SPARK_DESCRIPTION" Language="zh_Hans_CN">
      <Text>每座城市每有1人口，额外获得1生产力。建造者+1使用次数，并可消耗使用次数完成远古和古典时代奇观原始建造成本的15%。[NEWLINE]所有单位劫掠收益+100%。成功劫掠敌方城市所属的改良设施或区域时，使该城市人口减少1，最低降至1。间谍执行进攻任务时视为高2个等级。因忠诚度下降而脱离其他文明的城市，在来自本文明的忠诚压力最高时，跳过自由城市阶段直接加入本文明。[NEWLINE]成功劫掠改良设施或区域后，执行单位恢复全部生命值。</Text>
    </Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_TRAIT_COMMUNIST_SPARK_DESCRIPTION" Language="en_US">
      <Text>Cities gain +1 Production per citizen. Builders gain +1 build charge and can spend charges to complete 15% of the original Production cost of Ancient and Classical wonders.[NEWLINE]All units gain +100% pillage yields. Successfully pillaging an enemy city’s improvement or district reduces its population by 1, to a minimum of 1. Spies operate at 2 levels higher on offensive missions. Cities rebelling due to loyalty join this civilization directly when its loyalty pressure is highest.[NEWLINE]Units restore all HP after successfully pillaging an improvement or district.</Text>
    </Row>
